      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(x^2-3x+2=(x-1)(x-2),\\) the equation becomes \\[ (x-1)(x-2)x(x-4)=0. \\] Its roots are \\(0,\\) \\(1,\\) \\(2,\\) and \\(4.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
